Depends: libasound2t64 (>= 1.2.14)
Provides: alsa-ucm-conf (= 1.2.16.1)
Conflicts: alsa-ucm-conf
Replaces: alsa-ucm-conf
Description: ALSA Use Case Manager configuration (Libre Computer)
 Upstream alsa-ucm-conf with the Libre Computer board profiles on top. It
 replaces Debian's alsa-ucm-conf. The USB-Audio and sof-soundwire profile
 families are held at upstream 1.2.14 so the tree loads on alsa-lib 1.2.14.
